                        Text {
                            text: "The mornings are dark until ten. I would walk to the end of the breakwater with a thermos and watch the light come up behind the hills, first grey, then a thin band of orange that never quite made it to yellow. Most days the wind decided everything: whether the boats went out, whether the shop got its delivery, whether anyone bothered to talk."
